Notebook[{

Cell[CellGroupData[{
Cell["Parameterized Event Records Data Transformations", "Title",
 CellID->1620473143,ExpressionUUID->"77ab85ef-e56c-4ad8-847d-8cbaa21e44a0"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Introduction", "Section",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.970480801195269*^9, 3.970480805244128*^9}},
 CellID->492970311,ExpressionUUID->"a1e334ba-00b3-4757-a5ac-af7be3afbc80"],

Cell["\<\
In this document (notebook) we describe transformations of events records \
data in order to make that data more amenable for the application of Machine \
Learning (ML) algorithms.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.74639817051692*^9, 3.746398238117736*^9}, {
  3.74639829480794*^9, 3.746398310467093*^9}, {3.747235948749105*^9, 
  3.747235952787516*^9}, {3.9704808747843103`*^9, 3.970480879375925*^9}},
 CellID->1719848793,ExpressionUUID->"92a94696-b834-4eec-bd4f-b96b2d81280b"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Consider the following ",
 StyleBox["problem formulation",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 " (done with the next five bullet points.)"
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.747216061281084*^9, 3.74721609409837*^9}, {
  3.747216298671076*^9, 3.747216352524765*^9}, {3.7472164194973507`*^9, 
  3.747216470508066*^9}, {3.747216556612667*^9, 3.747216557760848*^9}, {
  3.747216635338664*^9, 3.747216713730489*^9}, {3.7472168186277733`*^9, 
  3.747216905589396*^9}, {3.747216975488696*^9, 3.747216977128594*^9}, {
  3.7472170916802673`*^9, 3.747217163643386*^9}, {3.747217258913086*^9, 
  3.7472172596194057`*^9}, {3.747235767746325*^9, 3.747235796951667*^9}, {
  3.747351582411989*^9, 3.7473516004316473`*^9}, {3.7473516383912163`*^9, 
  3.747351696240799*^9}, {3.7473517264249563`*^9, 3.74735182636867*^9}, {
  3.747663711889254*^9, 3.7476637166675653`*^9}},
 CellID->368775331,ExpressionUUID->"4658815b-2dad-437d-9f23-749d7468cb54"],

Cell["\<\
From data representing a (most likely very) diverse set of events we want to \
derive contingency matrices corresponding to each of the variables in that \
data. \
\>", "Item",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.747216061281084*^9, 3.74721609409837*^9}, {
  3.747216298671076*^9, 3.747216352524765*^9}, {3.7472164194973507`*^9, 
  3.747216470508066*^9}, {3.747216556612667*^9, 3.747216557760848*^9}, {
  3.747216635338664*^9, 3.747216713730489*^9}, {3.7472168186277733`*^9, 
  3.747216905589396*^9}, {3.747216975488696*^9, 3.747216977128594*^9}, {
  3.7472170916802673`*^9, 3.747217163643386*^9}, {3.747217258913086*^9, 
  3.7472172596194057`*^9}, {3.747235767746325*^9, 3.7472358054676228`*^9}, {
  3.7473514442383833`*^9, 3.74735148121558*^9}},
 CellID->369182875,ExpressionUUID->"4f54d9d0-4457-47d7-8b2b-514754c9d5a5"],

Cell["\<\
The events are observations of the values of a certain set of variables for a \
certain set of entities. Not all entities have events for all variables. \
\>", "Item",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.747216061281084*^9, 3.74721609409837*^9}, {
  3.747216298671076*^9, 3.747216352524765*^9}, {3.7472164194973507`*^9, 
  3.747216470508066*^9}, {3.747216556612667*^9, 3.747216557760848*^9}, {
  3.747216635338664*^9, 3.747216713730489*^9}, {3.7472168186277733`*^9, 
  3.747216905589396*^9}, {3.747216975488696*^9, 3.747216977128594*^9}, {
  3.7472170916802673`*^9, 3.747217163643386*^9}, {3.747217258913086*^9, 
  3.7472172596194057`*^9}, {3.747235767746325*^9, 3.7472358142766333`*^9}},
 CellID->776323942,ExpressionUUID->"1ae33760-1219-49a0-a481-9b53d7eff1f9"],

Cell["The observation times do not form a regular time grid. ", "Item",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.747216061281084*^9, 3.74721609409837*^9}, {
  3.747216298671076*^9, 3.747216352524765*^9}, {3.7472164194973507`*^9, 
  3.747216470508066*^9}, {3.747216556612667*^9, 3.747216557760848*^9}, {
  3.747216635338664*^9, 3.747216713730489*^9}, {3.7472168186277733`*^9, 
  3.747216905589396*^9}, {3.747216975488696*^9, 3.747216977128594*^9}, {
  3.7472170916802673`*^9, 3.747217163643386*^9}, {3.747217258913086*^9, 
  3.7472172596194057`*^9}, {3.747235767746325*^9, 3.747235817426536*^9}},
 CellID->1713337669,ExpressionUUID->"0ea1c190-081b-460a-b579-c7eb613558b9"],

Cell["\<\
Each contingency matrix has rows corresponding to the entities in the data \
and has columns corresponding to time. \
\>", "Item",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.747216061281084*^9, 3.74721609409837*^9}, {
  3.747216298671076*^9, 3.747216352524765*^9}, {3.7472164194973507`*^9, 
  3.747216470508066*^9}, {3.747216556612667*^9, 3.747216557760848*^9}, {
  3.747216635338664*^9, 3.747216713730489*^9}, {3.7472168186277733`*^9, 
  3.747216905589396*^9}, {3.747216975488696*^9, 3.747216977128594*^9}, {
  3.7472170916802673`*^9, 3.747217163643386*^9}, {3.747217258913086*^9, 
  3.7472172596194057`*^9}, {3.747235767746325*^9, 3.747235821015427*^9}},
 CellID->457980260,ExpressionUUID->"d029a714-3646-4ab3-9e57-23aa2b6d8106"],

Cell["\<\
The software component providing the functionality should allow \
parametrization and repeated execution. (As in ML classifier training and \
testing scenarios.)\
\>", "Item",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.747216061281084*^9, 3.74721609409837*^9}, {
   3.747216298671076*^9, 3.747216352524765*^9}, {3.7472164194973507`*^9, 
   3.747216470508066*^9}, {3.747216556612667*^9, 3.747216557760848*^9}, {
   3.747216635338664*^9, 3.747216713730489*^9}, {3.7472168186277733`*^9, 
   3.747216905589396*^9}, {3.747216975488696*^9, 3.747216977128594*^9}, {
   3.7472170916802673`*^9, 3.747217163643386*^9}, {3.747217258913086*^9, 
   3.7472172596194057`*^9}, {3.747235767746325*^9, 3.7472360332170143`*^9}, 
   3.747351524373004*^9},
 CellID->692838972,ExpressionUUID->"fd22ed81-6363-4ebb-b4b9-53838d4761bd"],

Cell["\<\
The phrase \[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]event records data\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote] \
is used instead of \[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]time series\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote] \
in order to emphasize that (i) some variables have categorical values, and \
(ii) the data can be given in some general database form, like transactions \
long-form.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.747241876195767*^9, 3.747242052405713*^9}, {
  3.747242090659169*^9, 3.747242094548086*^9}, {3.7473518451254463`*^9, 
  3.747351847676196*^9}},
 CellID->888268370,ExpressionUUID->"579e4fa1-a498-426f-80bd-82a4e5833bd0"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "The required transformations of the event records in the problem \
formulation above are done through the monad ",
 StyleBox["ERTMon", "Program"],
 ", [",
 ButtonBox["AAp3",
  BaseStyle->"Hyperlink",
  ButtonData->{
    URL["https://github.com/antononcube/MathematicaForPrediction/blob/master/\
MonadicProgramming/MonadicEventRecordsTransformations.m"], None},
  ButtonNote->
   "https://github.com/antononcube/MathematicaForPrediction/blob/master/\
MonadicProgramming/MonadicEventRecordsTransformations.m"],
 "]. (The name ERTMon comes from \[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]",
 StyleBox["E",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 "vent ",
 StyleBox["R",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 "ecords ",
 StyleBox["T",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 "ransformations ",
 StyleBox["Mon",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 "ad\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote].) "
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.746398322166923*^9, 3.746398380892479*^9}, {
  3.7463986716181307`*^9, 3.746398679944045*^9}, {3.747217460660102*^9, 
  3.747217467971632*^9}, {3.7472360589121*^9, 3.74723607408746*^9}, {
  3.747351256955028*^9, 3.7473512576303463`*^9}, {3.747351870955598*^9, 
  3.747351871459247*^9}, {3.747599917393722*^9, 3.747599977202223*^9}},
 CellID->1967664293,ExpressionUUID->"2ee6ad9a-47b3-4ffd-a022-2b8e2a3a7b99"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "The monad code generation and utilization is explained in [",
 ButtonBox["AA1",
  BaseStyle->"Hyperlink",
  ButtonData->{
    URL["https://mathematicaforprediction.wordpress.com/2017/06/23/monad-code-\
generation-and-extension/"], None},
  ButtonNote->
   "https://mathematicaforprediction.wordpress.com/2017/06/23/monad-code-\
generation-and-extension/"],
 "] and implemented with [",
 ButtonBox["AAp1",
  BaseStyle->"Hyperlink",
  ButtonData->{
    URL["https://github.com/antononcube/MathematicaForPrediction/blob/master/\
MonadicProgramming/StateMonadCodeGenerator.m"], None},
  ButtonNote->
   "https://github.com/antononcube/MathematicaForPrediction/blob/master/\
MonadicProgramming/StateMonadCodeGenerator.m"],
 "]."
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.746398322166923*^9, 3.746398380892479*^9}, {
  3.7463986716181307`*^9, 3.746398679944045*^9}, {3.747217460660102*^9, 
  3.747217467971632*^9}, {3.7472360589121*^9, 3.74723607408746*^9}, {
  3.747351256955028*^9, 3.7473512576303463`*^9}, {3.747351870955598*^9, 
  3.747351871459247*^9}, {3.747599917393722*^9, 3.7476000265552483`*^9}},
 CellID->1433092298,ExpressionUUID->"c17eaf8e-c098-4596-93f7-2fc446e49241"],

Cell["\<\
It is assumed that the event records data is put in a form that makes it \
(relatively) easy to extract time series for the set of entity-variable pairs \
present in that data. \
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.7463986950973253`*^9, 3.7463987265747757`*^9}, {
   3.747101758377447*^9, 3.747101823100215*^9}, {3.747101945591591*^9, 
   3.747102009460088*^9}, {3.7471020407595673`*^9, 3.7471020834313374`*^9}, 
   3.7472175783379097`*^9, {3.747217752160057*^9, 3.7472178437910633`*^9}, {
   3.747219174662138*^9, 3.747219248708579*^9}, {3.747236089847986*^9, 
   3.747236128353231*^9}},
 CellID->1953151381,ExpressionUUID->"20dbecf3-3149-4f18-a871-b75b7477b983"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "In brief ",
 StyleBox["ERTMon", "Program"],
 " performs the following sequence of transformations."
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.7463986950973253`*^9, 3.7463987265747757`*^9}, {
   3.747101758377447*^9, 3.747101823100215*^9}, {3.747101945591591*^9, 
   3.747102009460088*^9}, {3.7471020407595673`*^9, 3.7471020834313374`*^9}, 
   3.7472175783379097`*^9, {3.747217752160057*^9, 3.7472178437910633`*^9}, {
   3.747219174662138*^9, 3.747219248708579*^9}, {3.747236089847986*^9, 
   3.747236127132358*^9}, {3.747351911478078*^9, 3.7473519222071342`*^9}},
 CellID->180232425,ExpressionUUID->"fd3ad4e5-8191-4021-af42-18b102b124c7"],

Cell["\<\
The event records of each entity-variable pair are shifted to adhere to a \
specified start or end point,\
\>", "ItemNumbered",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.747101826404893*^9, 3.747101841929137*^9}, {
  3.747102014151476*^9, 3.7471020370336533`*^9}, {3.747102087267524*^9, 
  3.747102099575768*^9}, {3.747219270938656*^9, 3.747219277272461*^9}, {
  3.74735193050203*^9, 3.747351980574821*^9}},
 CellID->1214424705,ExpressionUUID->"96bbbb06-ded7-4ab6-8ae0-8d1c06cc0e2f"],

Cell["\<\
The event records for each entity-variable pair are aggregated and normalized \
with specified functions over a specified regular grid,\
\>", "ItemNumbered",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.747101826404893*^9, 3.7471019168448677`*^9}, {
  3.747102106843395*^9, 3.747102135093309*^9}, {3.747219298062852*^9, 
  3.747219299368001*^9}, {3.747351985550045*^9, 3.74735199201644*^9}},
 CellID->1151435847,ExpressionUUID->"ee3f3173-3aaa-4e61-b70a-fc1f6de9cfa7"],

Cell["\<\
Entity vs. time interval contingency matrices are made for each combination \
of variable and aggregation function.\
\>", "ItemNumbered",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.747101826404893*^9, 3.747101932631783*^9}, {
   3.747102137736876*^9, 3.7471022242978363`*^9}, 3.747352003482943*^9},
 CellID->1207137412,ExpressionUUID->"b55dd609-53d3-4006-a939-914b7d4061ef"],

Cell["\<\
The transformations are specified with a \[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]computation \
specification\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote] dataset. \
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.747101826404893*^9, 3.747101932631783*^9}, {
  3.747102137736876*^9, 3.74710225829622*^9}},
 CellID->1080470275,ExpressionUUID->"dc973303-b2d5-4332-8ff1-b5579943ed84"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[TextData[{
 "Here is an example of an ",
 StyleBox["ERTMon", "Program"],
 " pipeline over event records:"
}], "MathCaption",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.747102268263983*^9, 3.7471022825970383`*^9}, {
  3.7471379561354313`*^9, 3.747137972684432*^9}, {3.747352024721877*^9, 
  3.747352044003292*^9}},
 CellID->342192893,ExpressionUUID->"5e279fbf-6255-4b1c-8176-e26a58fa0d43"],

Cell[BoxData[
 TagBox[GridBox[{
    {
     TemplateBox[{
       StyleBox[
        TagBox[
         RowBox[{"ERTMonUnit", "[", "]"}], HoldForm], "Input", StripOnInput -> 
        False], 
       StyleBox[
       "\"\[ThinSpace]\[DoubleLongRightArrow]\"", "Input", StripOnInput -> 
        False]},
      "RowDefault"], 
     StyleBox["\<\"initialize the monad pipeline\"\>",
      StripOnInput->False,
      ShowAutoStyles->False,
      ShowSyntaxStyles->False,
      TranslationOptions->{"Enabled"->False},
      AutoNumberFormatting->False,
      FontWeight->"Normal",
      FontColor->RGBColor[0.27, 0.58, 0.68]]},
    {
     TemplateBox[{"\"  \"", 
       StyleBox[
        TagBox[
         RowBox[{"ERTMonSetEventRecords", "[", "\"eventRecords\"", "]"}], 
         HoldForm], "Input", StripOnInput -> False], 
       StyleBox[
       "\"\[ThinSpace]\[DoubleLongRightArrow]\"", "Input", StripOnInput -> 
        False]},
      "RowDefault"], 
     StyleBox["\<\"ingest event records\"\>",
      StripOnInput->False,
      ShowAutoStyles->False,
      ShowSyntaxStyles->False,
      TranslationOptions->{"Enabled"->False},
      AutoNumberFormatting->False,
      FontWeight->"Normal",
      FontColor->RGBColor[0.27, 0.58, 0.68]]},
    {
     TemplateBox[{"\"  \"", 
       StyleBox[
        TagBox[
         RowBox[{
          "ERTMonSetEntityAttributes", "[", "\"entityAttributes\"", "]"}], 
         HoldForm], "Input", StripOnInput -> False], 
       StyleBox[
       "\"\[ThinSpace]\[DoubleLongRightArrow]\"", "Input", StripOnInput -> 
        False]},
      "RowDefault"], 
     StyleBox["\<\"ingest event attributes\"\>",
      StripOnInput->False,
      ShowAutoStyles->False,
      ShowSyntaxStyles->False,
      TranslationOptions->{"Enabled"->False},
      AutoNumberFormatting->False,
      FontWeight->"Normal",
      FontColor->RGBColor[0.27, 0.58, 0.68]]},
    {
     TemplateBox[{"\"  \"", 
       StyleBox[
        TagBox[
         RowBox[{
          "ERTMonSetComputationSpecification", "[", "\"compSpec\"", "]"}], 
         HoldForm], "Input", StripOnInput -> False], 
       StyleBox[
       "\"\[ThinSpace]\[DoubleLongRightArrow]\"", "Input", StripOnInput -> 
        False]},
      "RowDefault"], 
     StyleBox["\<\"ingest computation specification\"\>",
      StripOnInput->False,
      ShowAutoStyles->False,
      ShowSyntaxStyles->False,
      TranslationOptions->{"Enabled"->False},
      AutoNumberFormatting->False,
      FontWeight->"Normal",
      FontColor->RGBColor[0.27, 0.58, 0.68]]},
    {
     TemplateBox[{"\"  \"", 
       StyleBox[
        TagBox["ERTMonGroupEntityVariableRecords", HoldForm], "Input", 
        StripOnInput -> False], 
       StyleBox[
       "\"\[ThinSpace]\[DoubleLongRightArrow]\"", "Input", StripOnInput -> 
        False]},
      "RowDefault"], 
     StyleBox["\<\"group records per {EntityID, Variable}\"\>",
      StripOnInput->False,
      ShowAutoStyles->False,
      ShowSyntaxStyles->False,
      TranslationOptions->{"Enabled"->False},
      AutoNumberFormatting->False,
      FontWeight->"Normal",
      FontColor->RGBColor[0.27, 0.58, 0.68]]},
    {
     TemplateBox[{"\"  \"", 
       StyleBox[
        TagBox[
         RowBox[{
          "ERTMonEntityVariableGroupsToTimeSeries", "[", 
           "\"\\\"MaxTime\\\"\"", "]"}], HoldForm], "Input", StripOnInput -> 
        False], 
       StyleBox[
       "\"\[ThinSpace]\[DoubleLongRightArrow]\"", "Input", StripOnInput -> 
        False]},
      "RowDefault"], 
     StyleBox["\<\"align the event records and create time series\"\>",
      StripOnInput->False,
      ShowAutoStyles->False,
      ShowSyntaxStyles->False,
      TranslationOptions->{"Enabled"->False},
      AutoNumberFormatting->False,
      FontWeight->"Normal",
      FontColor->RGBColor[0.27, 0.58, 0.68]]},
    {
     TemplateBox[{"\"  \"", 
       StyleBox[
        TagBox["ERTMonAggregateTimeSeries", HoldForm], "Input", StripOnInput -> 
        False]},
      "RowDefault"], 
     StyleBox["\<\"aggregate the time series\\n(according to the computation \
specification)\"\>",
      StripOnInput->False,
      ShowAutoStyles->False,
      ShowSyntaxStyles->False,
      TranslationOptions->{"Enabled"->False},
      AutoNumberFormatting->False,
      FontWeight->"Normal",
      FontColor->RGBColor[0.27, 0.58, 0.68]]}
   },
   AutoDelete->False,
   GridBoxAlignment->{"Columns" -> {{Left}}},
   GridBoxItemSize->{"Columns" -> {{Automatic}}, "Rows" -> {{Automatic}}}],
  "Grid"]], "Output",
 CellChangeTimes->{
  3.747138044387981*^9, {3.74760006914824*^9, 3.7476000794626513`*^9}},
 CellLabel->"Out[248]=",
 CellID->383225013,ExpressionUUID->"c4b95964-25a7-411a-87ad-b2d8a2a26819"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell["The rest of the document describes in detail:", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.747144728664587*^9, 3.7471448550247717`*^9}, {
  3.7471455999420757`*^9, 3.747145616707284*^9}, {3.7472193614008093`*^9, 
  3.747219376869589*^9}},
 CellID->559336138,ExpressionUUID->"0b844817-bdc9-412f-abbe-570ba5ed44ce"],

Cell["\<\
the structure, format, and interpretation of the event records data and \
computations specifications,\
\>", "Item",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.747144728664587*^9, 3.7471448550247717`*^9}, {
  3.7471455999420757`*^9, 3.747145616707284*^9}, {3.7472193614008093`*^9, 
  3.747219390154893*^9}},
 CellID->1226548447,ExpressionUUID->"7f1d9e4e-62b5-446f-8595-5813c1eaec67"],

Cell["\<\
the transformations of time series aligning, aggregation, and normalization,\
\>", "Item",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.747144728664587*^9, 3.7471448550247717`*^9}, {
  3.7471455999420757`*^9, 3.747145616707284*^9}, {3.7472193614008093`*^9, 
  3.747219441782988*^9}},
 CellID->904221176,ExpressionUUID->"47debef8-aed0-48c5-81e6-eee2751b21e1"],

Cell["\<\
the software pattern design -- a monad -- that allows sequential \
specifications of desired transformations.\
\>", "Item",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.747144728664587*^9, 3.7471448550247717`*^9}, {
  3.7471455999420757`*^9, 3.747145616707284*^9}, {3.7472193614008093`*^9, 
  3.747219409144887*^9}, {3.747219450265415*^9, 3.747219507742609*^9}, {
  3.747352075684702*^9, 3.7473520781804743`*^9}},
 CellID->1651018860,ExpressionUUID->"72ed1900-fb67-4bf6-aa68-e58cb1426479"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Concrete examples are given using weather data. See [",
 ButtonBox["AAp9",
  BaseStyle->"Hyperlink",
  ButtonData->{
    URL["https://github.com/antononcube/MathematicaForPrediction/blob/master/\
Misc/WeatherEventRecords.m"], None},
  ButtonNote->
   "https://github.com/antononcube/MathematicaForPrediction/blob/master/Misc/\
WeatherEventRecords.m"],
 "]."
