Cell["\<\
Most events can be described through \[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]Entity event data\
\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote]. The entities can be anything that produces a set of \
event data: financial transactions, vital sign monitors, wind speed sensors, \
chemical concentrations sensors.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.747147181685643*^9, 3.747147200955866*^9}, 
   3.747147337114291*^9, {3.7471473689832983`*^9, 3.747147414381702*^9}},
 CellID->269227610,ExpressionUUID->"22245413-fc3b-4034-b671-c324a6061829"],

Cell["\<\
The locations can be anything that gives the events certain \"spatial\" \
attributes: medical units in hospitals, sensors geo-locations, tiers of \
financial transactions.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.747147181685643*^9, 3.747147200955866*^9}, 
   3.747147337114291*^9, {3.747147532060134*^9, 3.7471475827961187`*^9}},
 CellID->160397041,ExpressionUUID->"63fe7b37-4e05-47a7-b7e3-12518f00579d"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Entity attributes data", "Subsection",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.747147602461052*^9, 3.747147611031828*^9}},
 CellID->701091102,ExpressionUUID->"a4f68b7d-6ca0-4049-a825-348aac933b12"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["\<\
The entity attributes dataset (table) has attributes (immutable properties) \
of the entities. (Like, gender and race for people, longitude and latitude \
for wind speed sensors.)\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.747147636818995*^9, 3.7471477362340727`*^9}},
 CellID->2142863872,ExpressionUUID->"87282c14-e930-48e1-89d7-1d7c6d7fa45a"],

