Cell["\<\
Using the package [AAp3] we can create computation specification dataset. \
Below is given an example of constructing a fairly complicated computation \
specification. \
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.747234110371719*^9, 3.747234111832817*^9}, {
   3.7472354031653643`*^9, 3.74723543212355*^9}, {3.7472355202470217`*^9, 
