Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Finding the variables outlier boundaries", "Subsection",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.747578100655287*^9, 3.74757812226689*^9}},
 CellID->559102668,ExpressionUUID->"e7d165e0-52d1-4ab9-9ca8-8b65bd934dcb"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "The finding of outliers counts and fractions can be specified in the \
computation specification. Because of this there is a specialized function \
for outlier finding ",
 StyleBox["ERTMonFindVariableOutlierBoundaries", "Program"],
 ". That function makes the association of the found variable outlier \
boundaries (i) to be the pipeline value and (ii) to be the value of context \
key \[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]variableOutlierBoundaries\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote]. \
The outlier boundaries are found using the functions of the package [",
 ButtonBox["AAp6",
  BaseStyle->"Hyperlink",
  ButtonData->{
    URL["https://github.com/antononcube/MathematicaForPrediction/blob/master/\
OutlierIdentifiers.m"], None},
  ButtonNote->
   "https://github.com/antononcube/MathematicaForPrediction/blob/master/\
OutlierIdentifiers.m"],
 "]."
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.747564895750204*^9, 3.747565012896941*^9}, {
  3.747565049839798*^9, 3.747565062801598*^9}, {3.747565836055657*^9, 
  3.7475658384963627`*^9}, {3.7475980509679213`*^9, 3.747598278972602*^9}, {
  3.7475983125428047`*^9, 3.747598312545903*^9}},
 CellID->1597585451,ExpressionUUID->"8f277f92-8bc6-4fc8-8d32-f37dcdab102b"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[TextData[{
 "If no argument is specified ",
 StyleBox["ERTMonFindVariableOutlierBoundaries", "Program"],
 " uses the Hampel identifier (",
 StyleBox["HampelIdentifierParameters", "Program"],
 ")."
}], "Text",
